{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The game is now titled **The Inconspicuous Wizard**, selected randomly from 50 candidates. The manual confirms the core rules: one shot in flight, corridor visibility backed by radar, an escaping bonus creature, and a teleporting Wizard. I’ve split the work across simulation, native rendering, and Hub integration while I build the menus, controls, audio, and packaging.\n"}}
