{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"The simulation and native renderer are implemented. An automated player has completed all six chambers using ordinary movement and firing commands; it reaches the ending, but that doesn’t establish human difficulty or run length. I’m now testing the packaged game, focusing on input, menus, shared-world play, and the finale’s warning windows.\n"}}
